  document.getElementById('reading-glass-icon').addEventListener('click', function() {
    // Your function code here
    console.log('Icon clicked!');
    // Call your function here
    myFunction();
  });

  function myFunction() {
    // Your function code here
    const inputField = document.getElementById('input-field');
    const inputValue = inputField.value;
    console.log('Input value:', inputValue);
    // Perform actions based on the input value
  }
</script>
```

This guide provides a basic structure for adding a clickable SVG icon to the right of an input field. You can customize the code to fit your specific needs and add more functionality as required.

